      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOURIGA (4) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Comes off a (29.91) win last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in a Grade 4/5 over 520m at this track. Appeals as a leading chance in this. JUST A BINDI (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (35.22) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including five wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from seven starts. Can do much better this time. TIC TAC MONELLI (3) had to overcome a collision with another runner and could manage only a distant fourth (35.25) in a Grade 5 over 601m at this track. May be worth another try. SWEET AS ELLE (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
